1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,510
Salama. Cu tu ka seni camo co?
Hello. How are you feeling?

2
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:06,840
Kemo pu ta ka puwe, sa ta ka pilo.
My head hurts, and I have a fever.

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,810
Puwe ke kome pi temo co?
When did the pain start?

4
00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:11,180
Puwe ke kome pi solu kin pume.
It started two days ago.

5
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:15,390
Puye ka ce tawa. Cu ku pinu suyu pulu, sa ku temu pulu.
It's not a big problem. Drink lots of water, and sleep a lot.

6
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:17,360
Ca ta ka caye sanawe?
Do I need medicine?

7
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:20,450
Ka. Cu ku tuma sanawe ti pi solulu.
Yes. Take this medicine in the evening.

8
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:24,740
Tane, sanayawa! Cu ta ka kiwe so ta ko sana kuwi.
Thank you, doctor! I hope I'll get well quickly.

